msgid "حذف %(object_name)s «%(escaped_object)s» این موردها را هم حذف می‌کند و حساب شما اجازه‌ی حذفشان را ندارد:"
msgstr "Deleting the %(object_name)s “%(escaped_object)s” would also delete these, and your account may not delete them:"

msgid "%(object_name)s «%(escaped_object)s» حذف نمی‌شود، چون این موردها به آن وابسته‌اند:"
msgstr "The %(object_name)s “%(escaped_object)s” cannot be deleted while these depend on it:"

